          <mj-text css-class="pb-cup3" align="center" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="17px" line-height="20px" color="#242424" padding-top="10px" padding-right="10px" padding-bottom="18px" padding-left="10px">Vale a partir de segunda, 26/10.</mj-text>
